WEBVTT

00:00:01.510 --> 00:00:03.950
This way!

00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:08.030
This is the way!

00:00:08.030 --> 00:00:10.060
You sure are cheerful, Asagao.

00:00:10.060 --> 00:00:11.430
Naturally!

00:00:11.430 --> 00:00:12.610
Yeah, really.

00:00:12.610 --> 00:00:16.120
She brightens up at the mere mention of food.

00:00:16.120 --> 00:00:20.560
You bet. And just for that, 
you don't get any.

00:00:20.560 --> 00:00:21.460
Huh?!

00:00:21.460 --> 00:00:24.340
We're out here gathering 
food in the first place

00:00:24.340 --> 00:00:26.920
because you scarfed down our 
team's emergency supply!

00:00:26.920 --> 00:00:30.200
I've got a big body, so I have to eat a lot!

00:00:30.200 --> 00:00:32.720
Says you, you overeater!

00:00:32.720 --> 00:00:35.030
I really won't give you a single piece.

00:00:35.030 --> 00:00:37.540
I put it all here for safe keep—

00:00:40.080 --> 00:00:41.780
It's g-gone.

00:00:41.780 --> 00:00:42.520
Huh?

00:00:43.090 --> 00:00:45.120
The chocolate vine that was here...

00:00:45.120 --> 00:00:47.730
It's all gone, you know.

00:00:47.730 --> 00:00:50.190
You probably ate it as soon as you found it.

00:00:50.190 --> 00:00:52.070
I did not!

00:00:52.070 --> 00:00:56.530
I wrote my name on it, and was 
waiting for it to get bigger!

00:00:58.440 --> 00:01:01.340
Maybe birds ate it, or something?

00:01:02.050 --> 00:01:04.480
This is quite tasty.

00:01:04.480 --> 00:01:05.160
Right!

00:01:05.160 --> 00:01:08.360
If I eat a delicious thing like this,

00:01:08.360 --> 00:01:11.100
maybe I'll become even cuter.

00:01:11.100 --> 00:01:12.090
Oh?

00:01:12.090 --> 00:01:16.840
Hinagiku, I simply couldn't 
<i>handle</i> you getting any cuter.

00:01:18.870 --> 00:01:21.140
Ugh, Team Horse.

00:01:21.140 --> 00:01:25.260
Nee-sama, I can't deal with them. 
Let's get out of here.

00:01:25.260 --> 00:01:26.690
There it is!

00:01:27.680 --> 00:01:29.300
That! That!

00:01:29.980 --> 00:01:33.460
That's my chocolate vine, you know!

00:01:29.980 --> 00:01:33.980
<b>A</b>

00:03:04.650 --> 00:03:06.910
That's my chocolate vine, you know!

00:03:07.280 --> 00:03:09.350
My name's written on it!

00:03:07.790 --> 00:03:11.420
<b>A Fight Over Some Fruit</b>

00:03:11.420 --> 00:03:13.420
<b>Munch...
Munch...</b>

00:03:11.820 --> 00:03:13.420
Well, let it go.

00:03:14.250 --> 00:03:20.000
When you consider how I can 
become cuter by eating this...

00:03:20.000 --> 00:03:22.550
It's a small price to pay, Hinagiku!

00:03:22.550 --> 00:03:25.010
It's a total ripoff, you know!

00:03:25.010 --> 00:03:28.850
<b>A</b>

00:03:25.010 --> 00:03:28.850
<b>A</b>

00:03:25.010 --> 00:03:28.850
<b>A</b>

00:03:25.010 --> 00:03:28.850
<b>A</b>

00:03:25.010 --> 00:03:28.850
<b>A</b>

00:03:25.010 --> 00:03:28.850
<b>A</b>

00:03:25.010 --> 00:03:28.850
And for that matter, I had 
my eye on those there, too!

00:03:29.250 --> 00:03:30.910
Hey, what's the big deal?

00:03:30.910 --> 00:03:33.000
Don't be so inflexible.

00:03:34.150 --> 00:03:37.730
I've heard enough! Give it back!

00:03:37.960 --> 00:03:39.090
Oniyuri.

00:03:39.090 --> 00:03:39.890
On it.

00:03:52.860 --> 00:03:54.830
Uh, Hinagiku.

00:03:55.410 --> 00:03:58.000
Please give it back to Asagao.

00:03:58.000 --> 00:03:59.890
It's an Akane Class rule.

00:03:59.890 --> 00:04:02.590
Things in the mountains belong 
to whose name is on them.

00:04:02.590 --> 00:04:04.180
That doesn't apply here.

00:04:04.180 --> 00:04:05.170
What?!

00:04:05.170 --> 00:04:07.340
All it says on them is "A."

00:04:07.340 --> 00:04:08.950
I wouldn't call that a name.

00:04:08.950 --> 00:04:11.230
I-It's my initial.

00:04:11.600 --> 00:04:14.200
I-I wish you'd accept that!

00:04:13.440 --> 00:04:14.770
Give up.

00:04:17.820 --> 00:04:21.440
Once Oniyuri decides something, 
she never backs down.

00:04:21.440 --> 00:04:24.400
You should go ahead and give up.

00:04:24.400 --> 00:04:26.630
This is turning into a pain.

00:04:26.630 --> 00:04:28.620
Would you mind leaving?

00:04:29.070 --> 00:04:34.250
I don't feel like heeding what anyone 
less cute than me says, anyway.

00:04:34.250 --> 00:04:37.560
In any case, you're wasting your time.

00:04:37.560 --> 00:04:41.920
Why not yield to my cuteness, 
and go find some other fruit?

00:04:41.920 --> 00:04:43.720
Hinagiku, that's...

00:04:43.720 --> 00:04:46.010
I'm done listening to this.

00:04:46.010 --> 00:04:48.770
That's some mouth you've got on you.

00:04:49.800 --> 00:04:52.310
Who do you think you are?!

00:04:54.130 --> 00:04:55.820
<i>Sazanka...</i>

00:04:57.210 --> 00:04:59.220
<i>For Asagao's sake...</i>

00:05:02.930 --> 00:05:04.890
<i>Even if all you do is fight,</i>

00:05:04.890 --> 00:05:07.580
<i>at the end of the day, you two are still...</i>

00:05:08.520 --> 00:05:12.200
What do you mean, "What anyone 
less cute than you says"?!

00:05:12.460 --> 00:05:16.280
Nee-sama is a hundred times 
cuter than the likes of you!

00:05:16.280 --> 00:05:17.670
Mhm!

00:05:17.670 --> 00:05:18.550
Eh?

00:05:19.860 --> 00:05:21.130
Huh?

00:05:21.130 --> 00:05:22.470
Isn't that right, Asagao?

00:05:22.470 --> 00:05:23.800
That's right!

00:05:23.800 --> 00:05:25.010
H-Hey...

00:05:25.010 --> 00:05:29.500
And stealing someone's food 
is not cute, you know!

00:05:30.890 --> 00:05:33.520
It's plain to see Hinagiku is cuter!

00:05:33.520 --> 00:05:35.740
No, Nee-sama is.

00:05:36.870 --> 00:05:38.280
Now, now.

00:05:38.280 --> 00:05:39.230
Listen, then.

00:05:39.600 --> 00:05:41.070
Let's do this.

00:05:41.070 --> 00:05:45.320
Tsubaki and I will compete 
to see who's cutest.

00:05:47.180 --> 00:05:49.700
Nee-sama will crush you with ease.

00:05:49.700 --> 00:05:51.490
Give back the fruit if we win!

00:05:52.360 --> 00:05:53.450
Fine.

00:05:54.120 --> 00:05:58.960
And if Tsubaki loses, 
give up and leave already.

00:06:01.460 --> 00:06:03.590
U-Um, excuse me...

00:06:03.590 --> 00:06:07.480
So? How do we decide this thing?

00:06:07.480 --> 00:06:09.800
Oh, about that.

00:06:11.790 --> 00:06:14.310
C-Can't move!

00:06:18.880 --> 00:06:20.060
Shadow Bind.

00:06:23.120 --> 00:06:25.150
We'll decide by majority vote.

00:06:25.400 --> 00:06:27.220
Sazanka! Asagao!

00:06:27.990 --> 00:06:30.220
I've got her, Hinagiku!

00:06:32.420 --> 00:06:34.950
Hey! How is this even fair?!

00:06:40.580 --> 00:06:42.210
Loyalty Trance Jutsu.

00:06:55.600 --> 00:07:01.150
Who is cuter? Me, or Tsubaki?

00:07:01.150 --> 00:07:03.300
Hinagiku!

00:07:03.770 --> 00:07:10.700
Heave-ho! Heave-ho! Heave-ho!

00:07:13.250 --> 00:07:15.120
Five votes!

00:07:15.120 --> 00:07:19.290
I win. Not that there was any doubt.

00:07:19.290 --> 00:07:22.170
Maybe there was no need to ask.

00:07:22.170 --> 00:07:25.570
Was there any need to 
compare in the first place?

00:07:25.570 --> 00:07:26.960
There sure wasn't.

00:07:30.720 --> 00:07:32.680
There are six of me.

00:07:33.050 --> 00:07:35.760
You're kidding. That's too advanced!

00:07:36.250 --> 00:07:38.440
And isn't it sneaky?!

00:07:38.440 --> 00:07:41.020
You're the ones who used Jutsu first.

00:07:42.190 --> 00:07:44.350
She does have a point.

00:07:44.350 --> 00:07:45.940
Hey, Oniyuri.

00:07:45.940 --> 00:07:49.210
Go defeat those copies, or I'm in trouble.

00:07:49.210 --> 00:07:50.510
Not gonna happen.

00:07:50.510 --> 00:07:53.070
They may be copies, but they're Tsubaki.

00:07:53.070 --> 00:07:54.500
And there're six of her.

00:07:55.820 --> 00:07:58.520
Time for another majority vote.

00:07:59.020 --> 00:08:02.750
Between me and Hinagiku, wh-which...

00:08:02.750 --> 00:08:07.170
<b><b>Fidget Fidget Fidget Fidget Fidget Fidget</b></b>

00:08:10.530 --> 00:08:14.090
Wh-Which one is c-cu—

00:08:28.440 --> 00:08:31.690
Why'd you have to go and scare me like that?

00:08:32.010 --> 00:08:37.240
Of course you couldn't keep 
six copies going for long.

00:08:37.240 --> 00:08:39.300
I-I was...

00:08:40.580 --> 00:08:45.710
I was too embarrassed to call myself cute!

00:08:52.750 --> 00:08:54.680
What's the matter, Hinagiku?

00:08:54.990 --> 00:08:58.890
Good for you! You won!

00:08:58.890 --> 00:09:02.180
But then, of course you did. You're cute.

00:09:08.460 --> 00:09:09.440
Nee-sama!

00:09:09.440 --> 00:09:10.730
Are you okay?

00:09:10.730 --> 00:09:13.320
I'm sorry, you two.

00:09:13.320 --> 00:09:15.720
No, it's not your fault.

00:09:15.720 --> 00:09:16.660
Ow!

00:09:19.700 --> 00:09:21.570
Hey! What gives?!

00:09:29.240 --> 00:09:30.190
Huh?

00:09:30.190 --> 00:09:31.630
Who care about these?!

00:09:31.630 --> 00:09:35.380
If you want them, you can have them all!

00:09:35.670 --> 00:09:36.930
Ow!

00:09:36.930 --> 00:09:39.470
There're some in here that 
aren't mine, you know.

00:09:39.470 --> 00:09:42.760
Shut up! I said you can have them all!

00:09:43.150 --> 00:09:46.620
I've had enough! I'm going home!

00:09:49.580 --> 00:09:51.270
Wait up, Hinagiku!

00:09:55.740 --> 00:09:59.140
If Hinagiku ends up thinking 
someone's cuter than her,

00:09:59.140 --> 00:10:03.200
her pride makes her wallow in despair.

00:10:03.960 --> 00:10:06.660
You girls win the competition.

00:10:08.800 --> 00:10:10.210
<i>We won?</i>

00:10:10.450 --> 00:10:12.390
That's my Nee-sama!

00:10:12.390 --> 00:10:13.070
Eh?

00:10:13.540 --> 00:10:14.500
Right...

00:10:14.500 --> 00:10:15.600
And hey, Asagao!

00:10:15.600 --> 00:10:16.050
Huh?

00:10:16.050 --> 00:10:17.820
Why're you eating already?!

00:10:17.820 --> 00:10:19.520
That's supposed to be for emergencies!

00:10:19.520 --> 00:10:22.640
Yeah, but I'm hungry!

00:10:22.640 --> 00:10:24.240
Hand it over!

00:10:23.150 --> 00:10:26.460
A-At what point did I win?

00:10:25.470 --> 00:10:26.460
Stop!

00:10:29.900 --> 00:10:34.360
<b>Independence and Indulgence</b>

00:10:30.500 --> 00:10:32.270
Look how dirty you got.

00:10:32.760 --> 00:10:34.680
You worked so hard, Ajisai.

00:10:34.680 --> 00:10:35.740
Yeah.

00:10:35.740 --> 00:10:37.590
And you feel fine?

00:10:37.590 --> 00:10:38.300
Yeah.

00:10:40.160 --> 00:10:42.320
Okay, now the other foot.

00:10:42.900 --> 00:10:44.540
<i>I'm Ajisai.</i>

00:10:45.040 --> 00:10:48.750
<i>Ox</i>

00:10:45.440 --> 00:10:46.620
<i>Team Ox.</i>

00:10:47.660 --> 00:10:51.970
<i>Right now, I have a very big issue.</i>

00:10:52.490 --> 00:10:53.710
<i>Namely...</i>

00:10:56.830 --> 00:10:57.760
Oh?

00:10:58.230 --> 00:11:02.550
<i>No, the issue isn't that I'm hungry.</i>

00:11:00.190 --> 00:11:02.550
Shion! Trouble!

00:11:03.130 --> 00:11:04.080
What's wrong?

00:11:05.500 --> 00:11:08.650
It sounds like Ajisai's starving.

00:11:08.650 --> 00:11:09.900
We can't have that.

00:11:09.900 --> 00:11:10.480
Huh?

00:11:10.480 --> 00:11:12.750
Shuriken training is on hold.

00:11:12.750 --> 00:11:16.250
I think I have some dried meat in my pouch.

00:11:16.250 --> 00:11:18.240
She probably wants something sweet, too.

00:11:18.240 --> 00:11:20.200
There's a fig tree nearby.

00:11:22.320 --> 00:11:24.660
Just hang in there a minute.

00:11:27.240 --> 00:11:28.500
That'll do.

00:11:30.440 --> 00:11:31.320
Here.

00:11:30.440 --> 00:11:31.320
Here.

00:11:32.660 --> 00:11:35.980
<i>This is Suzuran, also in Team Ox.</i>

00:11:34.090 --> 00:11:35.980
You trained so hard.

00:11:35.980 --> 00:11:38.070
<i>She's a kind older girl.</i>

00:11:35.980 --> 00:11:39.130
No wonder you're hungry. Have some.

00:11:41.260 --> 00:11:43.670
<i>This is Shion, our team leader.</i>

00:11:43.670 --> 00:11:46.300
Look, a fully ripe fig.

00:11:44.230 --> 00:11:47.430
<i>She's blunt, but strong and kind.</i>

00:11:46.300 --> 00:11:48.970
I bet it's sweet and tasty. Eat up.

00:11:51.060 --> 00:11:54.600
Ajisai truly is cute.

00:11:54.600 --> 00:11:55.230
Mhm.

00:11:55.230 --> 00:11:57.070
So cute!

00:11:56.170 --> 00:11:58.730
<i>And these two...</i>

00:11:57.440 --> 00:11:58.240
Yeah.

00:11:59.810 --> 00:12:01.290
<i>are overprotective.</i>

00:12:03.320 --> 00:12:07.200
<i>Oh, no! I let them baby me again!</i>

00:12:07.460 --> 00:12:09.410
Well? Is that enough?

00:12:09.410 --> 00:12:10.660
I'm done!

00:12:11.060 --> 00:12:13.540
<i>My issue is...</i>

00:12:12.260 --> 00:12:13.540
Done already?

00:12:13.540 --> 00:12:14.430
Yeah.

00:12:14.430 --> 00:12:18.510
<i>...that these two overindulge me.</i>

00:12:18.510 --> 00:12:19.470
Ajisai.

00:12:22.370 --> 00:12:23.440
Here you go.

00:12:28.980 --> 00:12:31.520
Maybe she wanted a different fruit.

00:12:31.520 --> 00:12:32.830
Okay, I'll go pick one.

00:12:32.830 --> 00:12:33.600
Don't bother!

00:12:35.820 --> 00:12:38.300
I-I'll pick it myself!

00:12:47.700 --> 00:12:50.580
Ajisai, are you okay?

00:12:51.080 --> 00:12:52.390
Hang on. I'll help you.

00:12:52.390 --> 00:12:54.370
I'm fine!

00:12:58.720 --> 00:13:00.030
You okay?

00:13:00.910 --> 00:13:02.340
That was a close call.

00:13:03.400 --> 00:13:05.300
You preferred that fruit?

00:13:05.300 --> 00:13:07.280
I'd have picked it, if you said so.

00:13:07.280 --> 00:13:08.430
That's right.

00:13:10.910 --> 00:13:15.780
<i>I'll be useless! I will, 
if I keep relying on these two!</i>

00:13:15.780 --> 00:13:18.400
<i>That's what I've realized lately.</i>

00:13:18.400 --> 00:13:20.310
It's dangerous up in trees.

00:13:20.310 --> 00:13:21.960
Don't try too hard.

00:13:21.960 --> 00:13:24.820
You're still a child.

00:13:25.100 --> 00:13:27.160
Stop treating me like a child!

00:13:27.160 --> 00:13:29.490
I'm a Team Ox member, too!

00:13:29.490 --> 00:13:31.450
I'm independent now!

00:13:35.040 --> 00:13:36.770
"Independent," she says!

00:13:36.770 --> 00:13:37.950
Well, well.

00:13:40.550 --> 00:13:42.210
You say the cutest things.

00:13:42.600 --> 00:13:43.980
Want some candy?

00:13:43.980 --> 00:13:44.890
Yup!

00:13:49.880 --> 00:13:51.280
Wait, Ajisai!

00:13:51.280 --> 00:13:52.890
It's dangerous alone!

00:13:53.350 --> 00:13:55.360
Don't follow me!

00:14:02.480 --> 00:14:07.110
When they pamper me, 
I end up going along with it.

00:14:07.110 --> 00:14:12.480
I'm sure the problem is that 
I don't seem independent.

00:14:13.000 --> 00:14:14.230
Okay!

00:14:14.230 --> 00:14:17.180
I'll find some way to 
get them to admit I am,

00:14:17.180 --> 00:14:19.710
and to stop indulging me!

00:14:21.920 --> 00:14:24.910
How, though?!

00:14:24.910 --> 00:14:26.100
Ajisai?

00:14:27.760 --> 00:14:29.510
Is something wrong?

00:14:30.390 --> 00:14:32.000
Team Dog.

00:14:32.000 --> 00:14:35.460
This is unusual, you being alone.

00:14:35.460 --> 00:14:36.910
It's true.

00:14:36.910 --> 00:14:40.190
You're always with Suzuran or Shion.

00:14:41.870 --> 00:14:42.940
Tsubaki!

00:14:43.770 --> 00:14:45.950
Fight a duel with me!

00:14:47.500 --> 00:14:48.160
Eh?

00:14:48.160 --> 00:14:52.070
Huh?! Where did <i>that</i> come 
from all of a sudden?!

00:14:52.070 --> 00:14:56.450
Nee-sama's not gonna fight 
with the likes of you!

00:14:58.010 --> 00:14:59.080
All right.

00:14:59.080 --> 00:15:01.000
Hey, Nee-sama!

00:14:59.870 --> 00:15:01.000
Thank you.

00:15:01.000 --> 00:15:03.880
No! This isn't for you to do!

00:15:03.880 --> 00:15:07.670
I can take her on, no problem!

00:15:08.070 --> 00:15:10.330
Not you. You're too unimpressive.

00:15:10.330 --> 00:15:11.470
Huh?!

00:15:11.470 --> 00:15:16.700
You always act so conceited, 
but then you fall back on Tsubaki.

00:15:16.700 --> 00:15:21.960
Huh? Well, <i>you're</i> always getting 
spoiled by Shion and Suzuran.

00:15:21.960 --> 00:15:24.440
You big baby.

00:15:29.600 --> 00:15:33.340
Fine, I'll start with Sazanka.

00:15:33.800 --> 00:15:35.240
And then, Tsubaki.

00:15:36.530 --> 00:15:39.430
I'll be waiting for you in the clearing!

00:15:39.430 --> 00:15:42.500
Tsubaki-chan, shouldn't you have stopped her?

00:15:44.690 --> 00:15:46.460
There was a serious look in her eyes.

00:15:46.870 --> 00:15:49.920
I'm sure she must have some reason for this.

00:15:56.310 --> 00:15:58.430
<i>If I duel with Tsubaki,</i>

00:15:58.910 --> 00:16:03.620
<i>I bet those two will admit 
that I'm independent!</i>

00:16:03.620 --> 00:16:05.360
Both of you, take your positions.

00:16:05.360 --> 00:16:06.420
<i>And first...</i>

00:16:07.520 --> 00:16:09.640
You go until one of you surrenders,

00:16:09.640 --> 00:16:11.530
or this hourglass runs out.

00:16:12.470 --> 00:16:13.490
Understood?

00:16:15.500 --> 00:16:16.340
Now, then.

00:16:18.190 --> 00:16:19.090
Begin!

00:16:30.840 --> 00:16:36.010
<i>O-O-Ow!</i>

00:16:42.680 --> 00:16:47.300
Stop running around!

00:16:51.820 --> 00:16:54.000
"Fight a duel with me," huh?!

00:16:54.000 --> 00:16:58.490
You've got a century to go before 
you reach Nee-sama's level!

00:17:00.270 --> 00:17:03.460
Just surrender already!

00:17:03.750 --> 00:17:04.710
<i>I can do it, too.</i>

00:17:07.040 --> 00:17:09.170
<i>I can do it, too!</i>

00:17:09.480 --> 00:17:11.170
Listen, Ajisai.

00:17:11.170 --> 00:17:16.890
<b>Ox</b>

00:17:12.530 --> 00:17:15.880
Step firmly on the ground, 
and put your strength into it.

00:17:15.880 --> 00:17:16.890
Watch.

00:17:16.890 --> 00:17:19.010
Step, and strike!

00:17:19.010 --> 00:17:21.220
Step, and strike!

00:17:22.070 --> 00:17:23.100
Give it a try.

00:17:23.100 --> 00:17:24.020
Okay!

00:17:26.060 --> 00:17:28.370
Step, and strike!

00:17:28.480 --> 00:17:30.650
Step, and strike!

00:17:30.760 --> 00:17:32.780
Step, and strike!

00:17:33.040 --> 00:17:34.940
<i>Step...</i>

00:17:35.310 --> 00:17:37.450
<i>and strike!</i>

00:17:42.070 --> 00:17:43.580
<i>It hit!</i>

00:17:48.000 --> 00:17:49.830
Substitution?!

00:17:49.830 --> 00:17:52.380
Oh, no!

00:17:55.160 --> 00:17:59.010
Gotcha! So easy!

00:17:59.990 --> 00:18:02.470
<i>Suzuran! Shion!</i>

00:18:02.880 --> 00:18:04.900
Going to run again?

00:18:05.730 --> 00:18:08.560
You're a baby, after all.

00:18:11.660 --> 00:18:13.750
That's right, I'm a baby!

00:18:13.750 --> 00:18:15.320
I can't help it!

00:18:15.320 --> 00:18:18.330
I enjoy being babied!

00:18:18.330 --> 00:18:19.110
Huh?!

00:18:19.110 --> 00:18:21.450
But that'll be my undoing,

00:18:21.450 --> 00:18:26.540
so I'll have those two approve 
of me, and stop indulging me!

00:18:26.540 --> 00:18:28.000
What's the big deal?!

00:18:28.000 --> 00:18:31.670
All you have to do is not depend on them!

00:18:32.030 --> 00:18:36.460
It's harder than you make it sound!

00:18:36.460 --> 00:18:39.440
You're gonna be spoiled forever!

00:18:39.440 --> 00:18:41.240
Shut up! Shut up!

00:18:41.240 --> 00:18:42.470
You can't do anything by yourself!

00:18:41.240 --> 00:18:46.190
This has sunken to the level 
of children quarreling...

00:18:42.470 --> 00:18:46.660
I'm not depending on them because I want to!

00:18:46.660 --> 00:18:49.100
I don't even know what that means!

00:18:51.750 --> 00:18:52.610
That's enough!

00:18:59.220 --> 00:19:00.490
It's a draw.

00:19:02.920 --> 00:19:04.700
With a baby...

00:19:04.700 --> 00:19:07.700
With Sazanka!

00:19:08.080 --> 00:19:16.880
A-At this rate, Suzuran and Shion 
will never say I'm independent!

00:19:22.970 --> 00:19:24.760
That's not true.

00:19:27.590 --> 00:19:28.890
You were trying hard.

00:19:29.260 --> 00:19:30.890
When did you get here?

00:19:31.570 --> 00:19:33.790
Partway through.

00:19:33.790 --> 00:19:37.600
We hear you challenged Tsubaki, 
at first. That's crazy.

00:19:38.480 --> 00:19:40.880
Well, I...

00:19:42.810 --> 00:19:45.910
I'm sorry we laughed at you.

00:19:45.910 --> 00:19:48.040
You're plenty independent.

00:19:48.040 --> 00:19:51.620
Sorry, Ajisai. You did great.

00:19:55.400 --> 00:19:56.950
Are you hurt?

00:19:56.950 --> 00:20:00.340
Well, just a little.

00:20:00.640 --> 00:20:04.400
Thank goodness. Looks like 
that's been resolved.

00:20:00.640 --> 00:20:04.400
Oh, no. We've got to get 
you treated right away.

00:20:04.400 --> 00:20:06.300
Oh, I'm fine!

00:20:04.400 --> 00:20:06.300
Mhm!

00:20:07.860 --> 00:20:09.410
<i>I'm Ajisai.</i>

00:20:09.850 --> 00:20:12.930
<i>I've been deemed independent.</i>

00:20:12.930 --> 00:20:16.400
<i>Now they won't pamper me anymore!</i>

00:20:17.070 --> 00:20:18.940
<b>Food</b>

00:20:17.070 --> 00:20:18.940
<b>Dining
Hall</b>

00:20:17.470 --> 00:20:18.940
<i>Or, so I thought.</i>

00:20:18.940 --> 00:20:22.320
Here, I took out the fish bones for you.

00:20:22.320 --> 00:20:23.900
Yay!

00:20:24.320 --> 00:20:25.840
But why?!

00:20:26.690 --> 00:20:28.110
What's wrong?

00:20:28.110 --> 00:20:30.830
Here, I'll give you a pickled plum. 
You like those, right?

00:20:30.830 --> 00:20:32.750
<b>Ajisai</b>

00:20:30.830 --> 00:20:32.750
Oh, yeah!

00:20:33.020 --> 00:20:35.160
I mean, stop it!

00:20:35.160 --> 00:20:35.710
Stop what?

00:20:35.710 --> 00:20:37.980
Pampering me!

00:20:37.980 --> 00:20:40.740
I'm independent!

00:20:41.840 --> 00:20:45.610
Did you do what you did because 
you don't want to be pampered?

00:20:45.610 --> 00:20:47.160
Th-That's right.

00:20:47.160 --> 00:20:49.200
Then you've got the wrong idea.

00:20:49.200 --> 00:20:49.850
Huh?

00:20:49.850 --> 00:20:51.600
That's right.

00:20:51.600 --> 00:20:57.240
We're pampering you because 
you're so cute, we can't resist.

00:20:57.240 --> 00:20:58.690
That's it.

00:21:00.110 --> 00:21:03.320
Here, have some fruit, too. 
You like it, right?

00:21:03.320 --> 00:21:06.600
I'll tie up your hair so it's easy to eat.

00:21:06.600 --> 00:21:08.660
Here, I peeled it.

00:21:08.980 --> 00:21:11.760
<i>It wasn't resolved at all.</i>

00:21:12.210 --> 00:21:15.400
Nee-sama, I worked hard today.

00:21:15.400 --> 00:21:17.550
I want you to feed me.

00:21:17.550 --> 00:21:21.020
Look how cute she is, Shion.

00:21:21.020 --> 00:21:21.750
Whoa!

00:21:21.750 --> 00:21:24.360
I'm begging you, stop!

00:21:24.360 --> 00:21:27.720
Because I'll give in!

00:22:58.120 --> 00:22:59.900
There, all done.

00:23:02.190 --> 00:23:03.890
That's a good look for you.

00:23:04.800 --> 00:23:06.820
Really? Thank you!

00:23:07.100 --> 00:23:08.890
Stare...

00:23:10.000 --> 00:23:12.590
Shall we do that for you, too, Sazanka?

00:23:17.370 --> 00:23:19.910
That looks good, Sazanka!

00:23:19.910 --> 00:23:22.380
You both look cute.

00:23:22.380 --> 00:23:23.080
Mhm.

00:23:23.780 --> 00:23:25.320
Want to do it, too, Asagao?

00:23:25.320 --> 00:23:26.800
Can I?!

00:23:29.510 --> 00:23:36.970
<b>Horse</b>

00:23:29.510 --> 00:23:36.970
<b>A
k
a
n
e

00:23:30.010 --> 00:23:32.080
Let's stay inside today.

00:23:32.080 --> 00:23:33.810
It's dangerous out here.

00:23:33.810 --> 00:23:36.970
You're cute even when you cry, Hinagiku!

00:23:36.970 --> 00:23:39.080
To be continued!

00:23:36.970 --> 00:23:40.230
<b>Next time:
